A furnished room with private bathroom is available from Mar 18 in a 2-bedroom, 2-bathroom downtown condo with a great downtown view.

The suite features:
- hardwood flooring;
- granite kitchen countertops;
- balcony;
- home theatre;
- in-suite washer and dryer;
- microwave;
- dishwasher that will save you a lot of time and effort :)

In the room, there are:
- queen-size bed;
- closet;
- chest;
- table and chair.

There is also a locker available downstairs where you can put the stuff you don't need in the unit.

The condo features:
- absolutely gorgeous rooftop with a garden, barbecue stations, and outdoor jacuzzi!
- coffee lounge;
- billiards room;
- party room;
- conference room;
- 2-level gym with a mini basketball court;
- sauna;
- indoor jacuzzi;
- small library.

The condo is conveniently located a 10-minute walk away from the financial core on one side and the Distillery district on the other.

The rent is $1795/mth, and I'll ask you to pay first and last month rent up front. All the utilities are included. Unlimited high-speed Internet is ~$50/mth extra, and cable TV can be connected as well if you'd like to use them.

Please call/text Costa at 647-639-0111 or reply to this posting if interested.

